# Who must review what.
#
# There is deliberately no `*` rule. Agents open and merge their own pull
# requests autonomously, and a catch-all owner would force a human review on
# every one of them. Only paths that can change CI credentials, the published
# image or the release version need a human reviewer.
#
# Reviewer enforcement comes from "Require review from Code Owners" on `main`,
# which only counts approvals from the matching owner below.

/.github/         @Kookster310
/docker/          @Kookster310
/pyproject.toml   @Kookster310
